  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISSC Internat. Social Science Council 2011-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISSC Internat. Social Science Council 2011-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xE4;r att skapa en process i vilken ISSC i          samverkan med sina regionala partners can utforma ett framtida        Globalt Forsknings och Koordinerings Initiative om kliamtf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringar f&#xF6;r samh&#xE4;llsvetenskaperna. Projektet skall resultera i en ans&#xF6;kan     fr&#xE5;n ISSC om st&#xF6;d till ett s&#xE5;dant l&#xE5;ngsiktigt intiative. Den b&#xF6;r ta   upp agenda, policy, och mekanismer f&#xF6;r koordinering o finansiering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to create a process by which ISSC in        collaboration with regional partners can design a future Global       Research and Coordination Initiative on climate change for the social sciences. The project will result in an application from ISSC for     such a long-term initiative. It will address research agenda setting, policy interface, and mechanisms for global coordination and funding.</narrative>
  </description>
